hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"139","[AI-translation] Ewe Allah! Tunakufanya Wewe shingoni mwao [dhidi yao] na tunajikinga Kwako na shari zao. [Husomwa akiogopa adui]"
"140","[AI-translation] Ewe Allah! Wewe ni mkono wangu na msaidizi wangu; Nawe natembea, Nawe nashambulia, Nawe napigana. [Husomwa akutapo na adui]"
"141","[AI-translation] Allah Ananitosha; naye ni Mbora wa mtegemewa. [Husomwa akutapo na adui]"
